# Frontend (Next.js 15 + TS)

## App Router
- App lives under `frontend/app/`; root layout is Server Component (`layout.tsx` metadata + fonts)
- Dashboard page (`app/page.tsx`) is **`'use client'`** — v3 panels need hooks, polling, and charts
- Add `'use client'` only when using state, effects, browser APIs, or event handlers

## Data fetching
- Use `getApiBase()` from `app/lib/apiBase.ts` for all `/api` calls
- Browser: same-origin `/api` (proxy/rewrite); SSR/dev server: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` or `http://localhost:3000/api`
- Batch dashboard loads via `V3DashboardDataProvider` + `app/lib/v3DashboardFetchers.ts` — extend fetchers/types there instead of duplicating `fetch` in panels
- Shared UI types: `app/types/index.ts`; panel-specific shapes stay next to fetchers when API-only

## UI structure
- **Sections** (`app/sections/`): page panels (e.g. `MarketChartPanel`, `SignalGatePanel`)
- **Components** (`app/components/`, `app/components/ui/`): reusable pieces; use `Card`, `CardHeader`, `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`
- **Contexts** (`app/contexts/`): cross-panel state (v3 dashboard slices)
- **Hooks** (`app/hooks/`): reusable client logic
- Default method/symbol in UI: `kim_nghia`, `BTC` unless product scope changes

## Styling
- Tailwind utility classes; theme tokens like `bg-bg-primary`, `text-accent-primary`, `border-border-default`
- Keep layout responsive (`sm:`, `lg:` breakpoints); no business rules in JSX — compute in hooks/lib helpers

## Imports
- Prefer `@/app/...`, `@/lib/...` aliases from `tsconfig.json`
- `clsx` + `tailwind-merge` via `cn()` for class composition
